Prism bundles the `dwg2dxf` command-line tool and its `libredwg` shared
library, unmodified apart from relinking their internal library reference to
a path relative to the executable (via `install_name_tool`, macOS build only)
so the pair runs without a system-wide LibreDWG install. It converts a
customer's own .dwg file to .dxf on their own machine, as a fallback when the
ODA File Converter is not installed — see
prism_terminal/core/vendor/dwg2dxf/README.md for build provenance and where
to get the matching source.

